    "summary": "As your opponent's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick 1 **visible** enemy unit up to 36\" from this unit, other than **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)**, **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units, and roll a D6 for it. On a 2+, it takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**, and until your next turn ends:\n\n- it cannot be **hidden**\n- ranged attacks against it have **[[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover)**",
